# One env file for the whole repo, read by contracts, solver and app alike.
# Three copies means three chances to hold a different RPC or a different address,
# and that kind of failure shows up as a wrong answer rather than as an error.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env itself is never committed.
#
# There are no private keys here, and there never will be. Deploys are signed with
# cast wallet or a hardware wallet, passed to forge as --account or --ledger.
# Values that are production facts rather than secrets, such as the USDG address,
# live in docs/parameter.md and then in code constants, not here.

# Chain endpoints. The official mainnet domain is intercepted by Indonesian ISP
# DNS, so this is the provider endpoint that answers without a workaround. It is a
# full node rather than an archive one and keeps state for roughly the last twenty
# to forty thousand blocks, so never pin a block number against it.
NOKTURN_RPC_MAINNET=https://robinhood.drpc.org
NOKTURN_RPC_TESTNET=https://rpc.testnet.chain.robinhood.com

# Where protocol fees, seized bonds and cross dust are sent.
NOKTURN_TREASURY=

# The timelock is the governor of every contract that has one, and governor is
# immutable, so these are decided before the first deploy and not after. Comma
# separated, no spaces. Proposers are also cancellers.
NOKTURN_TIMELOCK_PROPOSERS=
NOKTURN_TIMELOCK_EXECUTORS=
